 "9801": {
  "en": [
   "It cannot be borne, cannot be borne — the heart weeps.",
   "The beloved forest has become a cremation ground.",
   "The robber band has come and destroyed all peace,",
   "every direction trembles in terror.",
   "The forest is distraught, the breeze weeps,",
   "the deer are startled, the birds sing no song.",
   "The green blades of grass are drenched in blood,",
   "stone splits at the sound of anguished weeping.",
   "Goddess Durga, look upon us — save this forest,",
   "protect your humble servant, grant the gift of peace."
