 "9803": {
  "en": [
   "Today then, all together, we shall divide up the plunder,",
   "and what havoc I wrought on rite and sacrifice to bring all this in.",
   "When there is work to do, who knows where he slips away,",
   "but when shares are dealt he comes first (hey, brother).",
   "Such insolence from you — what is this joking and jeering at me!",
   "This instant I will chop your heads to pieces — beware, oh beware!",
   "Ha ha — brother is in a mighty rage; what a to-do!",
   "Today, by the look of him, he will grind the world to snuff.",
   "Such a warrior he is — the scars are all on his back,",
   "rust on his sword, rage only on his lips.",
   "My heart can bear no more of this —",
   "have you no love of your own lives?",
   "My limbs are trembling with terrible rage.",
   "Where is my club, where is my shield?",
