 "9804": {
  "en": [
   "We are all bound by a single cord.",
   "We heed no prohibition, we heed no rule, we heed no one.",
   "Who is king, whose kingdom — what do we know?",
   "Every one of us is a king, and the forest itself our capital!",
   "King or subject, high or low — we count them as nothing!",
   "In all the three worlds we fear no one,",
   "Kali is above our heads, and victory lies before us!"
